From: mscharged-port native source preparation
Subject: [PATCH] Provide original Wii SDK progressive and EURGB60 modes
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4
Classification: permanent host graphics SDK compatibility.

Restore absent mode data from Charged GXFrameBuf.c at bab83befb5d6a2fdff0b30d2ec4b59f7251a108d.
The game retains its original mode selection and overscan requests. Correct the
existing host MPAL mode identifier to the actual MPAL value8. No mode aliases.

